<title>USA: Lake Ariel sets combined div of $0.22.</title>
<headline>Lake Ariel sets combined div of $0.22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lake Ariel Bancorp Inc said Tuesday it will pay a regular quarterly dividend of $0.17 per share, plus a $0.05 special dividend.</p>
<p>Both dividends will be paid together December 13 to stockholders of record as of November 15, the company said.</p>
</text>
